```
Stage 2 — Kerberoasting Detection
Event ID 4769 (Kerberos Service Ticket Request), RC4 encryption (0x17)

Lab query:
```

index=wineventlog EventCode=4769 Ticket_Encryption_Type=0x17
| stats count by Account_Name, Service_Name, Client_Address

```
Production-tuned variant (suppresses normal renewal noise):
```

index=wineventlog EventCode=4769 Ticket_Encryption_Type=0x17
| stats count by Account_Name, Service_Name, Client_Address
| where count > 5

```
A single RC4 request (as captured live in this lab) is still worth investigating
but carries lower confidence on its own — see README Stage 2 note.
```
